        "original_id": "6ec0e749-d515-52ec-bb7c-34099261ce3e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johnny Herbert, Rubens Barrichello\n- Organizations: Stewart Grand Prix\n- Events: 1999 Formula One season, European Grand Prix, French Grand Prix, Constructors' Championship, 1992 Formula One Indoor Trophy\n- Topics: Formula One\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny Herbert was born on 25 June 1964 and is a British racing driver.\n- Johnny Herbert won the 1992 Formula One Indoor Trophy while driving a Lotus-Ford.\n- Johnny Herbert raced in Formula One from 1989 to 2000 for seven different teams, won three races, and finished fourth in the 1995 championship.\n- Stewart Grand Prix had its strongest season in 1999, with Johnny Herbert winning the European Grand Prix and Rubens Barrichello taking pole position at the French Grand Prix.\n- Stewart Grand Prix finished fourth overall in the 1999 Constructors' Championship.",
